```mermaid
%% Functional Specification Diagram
%% Process Flow for AI Dialer
flowchart TD
    Start["Start"] --> UploadContactList["User uploads the contact list"]
    UploadContactList --> ValidateContacts["System validates the contact list"]
    ValidateContacts --> ValidList{Is the contact list valid?}
    ValidList -- Yes --> ProcessList["AI Dialer starts processing the list"]
    ValidList -- No --> NotifyUser["Notify user of errors"]
    NotifyUser --> UploadContactList

    ProcessList --> CallCustomer["Dial a customer's number"]
    CallCustomer --> Response{Did the customer respond?}
    Response -- Yes --> OfferPackage["AI offers the travel package"]
    Response -- No --> RetryLogic["Retry logic up to 3 times"]

    OfferPackage --> AcceptOffer{Did the customer accept the offer?}
    AcceptOffer -- Yes --> TransferToAgent["Transfer call to the human agent"]
    AcceptOffer -- No --> PersuadeCustomer["Try persuading the customer (up to 3 attempts)"]
    PersuadeCustomer --> ConvinceSuccess{Customer convinced?}
    ConvinceSuccess -- Yes --> TransferToAgent
    ConvinceSuccess -- No --> RecordOutcome["Record call outcome in the database"]

    RetryLogic --> MaxRetries{Max retries exceeded?}
    MaxRetries -- Yes --> RecordOutcome
    MaxRetries -- No --> CallCustomer

    RecordOutcome --> UpdateDashboard["Generate reports and update dashboard"]
    UpdateDashboard --> End["End"]
```